{"4074100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chester at the Park", "steam_appid": 4074100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chester at the Park</i> is a charming puzzle game with dogs and chess pieces. Pick up the chess pieces and lead Chester through the puzzles while the critters of the Checkered Meadows cheer you on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074100/extras/389250fb490d6132703a8071db4b75da.avif?t=1784776456\" width=1024 height=256 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These puzzles are no walk in the park, but the park has much more to offer. Explore the pretty ponds and cozy scenes, make new friends, or take some time to reflect on that one puzzle in the Zen garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meticulously hand-crafted  to bring character to every corner of the park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chester at the Park</i> is a charming puzzle game with dogs and chess pieces. Pick up the chess pieces and lead Chester through the puzzles while the critters of the Checkered Meadows cheer you on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074100/extras/389250fb490d6132703a8071db4b75da.avif?t=1784776456\" width=1024 height=256 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These puzzles are no walk in the park, but the park has much more to offer. Explore the pretty ponds and cozy scenes, make new friends, or take some time to reflect on that one puzzle in the Zen garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meticulously hand-crafted  to bring character